{"1958160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "moorestech", "steam_appid": 1958160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/202fddee2f54e6e30c26ebe01147a0d8.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Windmills spin, gears mesh, and machines roar to life. Tune rotation speed and torque to design your very own power network.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High RPM or high torque? Tinker with gear ratios to pursue efficient power transmission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run short on power and your machines grind to a halt. This is hands-on, physical engineering you can’t get from simply connecting wires.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c048943c59704e7bb64523dde0c0c9ef.poster.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c048943c59704e7bb64523dde0c0c9ef.webm?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c048943c59704e7bb64523dde0c0c9ef.mp4?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/544e9e7f18a09c083678283b87ac5429.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a colossal factory as you trace humanity’s technological history.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From waterwheels to steam engines, electricity, and fusion. With every leap in technology, what you can do expands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate everything from mining and smelting to processing and assembly—build a production network where materials flow on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to build a rocket. Develop your factory and aim for a return home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/fa5da73460179d72f5a85fdde2e3ff5d.poster.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/fa5da73460179d72f5a85fdde2e3ff5d.webm?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/fa5da73460179d72f5a85fdde2e3ff5d.mp4?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/05ba993555fbd4f64edeb2d0a755b8b2.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exiled Princess Yori and her colorful companions. Why was she cast out? The truth awaits in the story.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yori (left): The second princess of planet Celestal. Exiled to planet Arcadia without even knowing why. She starts out as a sheltered young lady who can’t do much, but with Ereno’s help, she pushes industrialization forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ereno (middle): A general-purpose support AI system who came to planet Arcadia with Yori as her attendant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kurua (right): Athletic, genuinely bright, and easygoing. Friendly and chatty. She loves money—and will do anything to survive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/1d1ec0569052db40369432a186edfd80.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1288 height=770 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/8ee25cac6abf689ba5b9e66e72502564.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A gentle tutorial explains the basics of factory automation from scratch—no experience needed.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete step-by-step tutorial that teaches the fundamentals of factory automation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more “I don’t know what to do next.” Your companions will guide you toward your next objective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veteran players can skip the tutorial and jump straight into serious construction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c1d7d5429298eaeef26c56f047134c4e.poster.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c1d7d5429298eaeef26c56f047134c4e.webm?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c1d7d5429298eaeef26c56f047134c4e.mp4?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/17fdfea757d5597636cb7c000e05c482.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate Modding Environment—Powered by Open Source and Dedicated Tools</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create mods with a dedicated editor—no coding required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game’s full source code is publicly available on GitHub.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned support for Steam Workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/8fe6ccd16adad7a8008bf14d5a8ea4c8.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/202fddee2f54e6e30c26ebe01147a0d8.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Windmills spin, gears mesh, and machines roar to life. Tune rotation speed and torque to design your very own power network.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High RPM or high torque? Tinker with gear ratios to pursue efficient power transmission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run short on power and your machines grind to a halt. This is hands-on, physical engineering you can’t get from simply connecting wires.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c048943c59704e7bb64523dde0c0c9ef.poster.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c048943c59704e7bb64523dde0c0c9ef.webm?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c048943c59704e7bb64523dde0c0c9ef.mp4?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/544e9e7f18a09c083678283b87ac5429.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a colossal factory as you trace humanity’s technological history.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From waterwheels to steam engines, electricity, and fusion. With every leap in technology, what you can do expands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate everything from mining and smelting to processing and assembly—build a production network where materials flow on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to build a rocket. Develop your factory and aim for a return home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/fa5da73460179d72f5a85fdde2e3ff5d.poster.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/fa5da73460179d72f5a85fdde2e3ff5d.webm?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/fa5da73460179d72f5a85fdde2e3ff5d.mp4?t=1784543413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/05ba993555fbd4f64edeb2d0a755b8b2.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exiled Princess Yori and her colorful companions. Why was she cast out? The truth awaits in the story.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yori (left): The second princess of planet Celestal. Exiled to planet Arcadia without even knowing why. She starts out as a sheltered young lady who can’t do much, but with Ereno’s help, she pushes industrialization forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ereno (middle): A general-purpose support AI system who came to planet Arcadia with Yori as her attendant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kurua (right): Athletic, genuinely bright, and easygoing. Friendly and chatty. She loves money—and will do anything to survive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/1d1ec0569052db40369432a186edfd80.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1288 height=770 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/8ee25cac6abf689ba5b9e66e72502564.avif?t=1784543413\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A gentle tutorial explains the basics of factory automation from scratch—no experience needed.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete step-by-step tutorial that teaches the fundamentals of factory automation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more “I don’t know what to do next.” Your companions will guide you toward your next objective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veteran players can skip the tutorial and jump straight into serious construction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958160/extras/c1d7d5429298eaeef26c56f047134c4e.poster.avif?t=1784543413\" width=600 height=150 ><sour